{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows疑似SSH反向端口转发。对应需求：命令控制。官方：Potential SSH Reverse Port Forwarding。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows疑似SSH反向端口转发","references":["https://thedfirreport.com/2025/11/04/from-bing-search-to-ransomware-bumblebee-and-adaptixc2-deliver-akira-2/","https://thedfirreport.com/2023/10/30/netsupport-intrusion-results-in-domain-compromise/","https://x.com/Securityinbits/status/2067602540209021196"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"86817045-ea22-4038-9959-c3437bc4c064","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 命令控制","来源: 默认","对应需求: 命令控制"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n  (\n    process.name : (\"ssh.exe\", \"plink.exe\") or\n    ?process.pe.original_file_name : (\"Plink\", \"plink.exe\")\n  ) and\n  (\n    process.args like \"-R*\" or\n    process.args : \"-oRemoteForward*\" or\n    (process.args == \"-o\" and process.args : \"*RemoteForward*\") or\n\n    /* -R can be combined with ~20 no-arg SSH flags (e.g. -NR, -fNR) */\n    process.args regex \"\"\"-[46AaCfGgKkMNnqsTtVvXxYy]+R.*\"\"\"\n  )\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows疑似SSH反向端口转发\n\n### 为何重要\n建立外连、隧道或远程管理通道\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1090","name":"Proxy","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1090/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1090.002","name":"External Proxy","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1090/002/"}]},{"id":"T1572","name":"Protocol Tunneling","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1572/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1021.004","name":"SSH","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"version":3,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
